    "stop_reason": "success",
    "result_text": "All 61 tests pass. \n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `selfLink` field on the owner representation so that `GET /api/owners/{id}` returns `selfLink = \"/api/owners/\" + id`.\n\nSince `OwnerDto` is generated at build time from the OpenAPI spec and its derived fields are computed in the MapStruct mapper, the change spanned two files:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `selfLink` string property to the `Owner` schema (which regenerates `OwnerDto` with a `selfLink` field).\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a mapping that populates it:\n   ```java\n   @Mapping(target = \"selfLink\",\n       expression = \"java(owner.getId() == null ? null : \\\"/api/owners/\\\" + owner.getId())\")\n   ```\n\nThe null guard keeps the mapper safe when mapping an owner that hasn't been persisted yet. This flows through both `RespondWithOwner` (GET) and `RespondWithOwnerCreated` (POST), which the acceptance test `Cp49Tests` verifies via `GET /api/owners/{id}`.\n\nThe full acceptance suite (61 tests) is green.",
